&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;StackAdapt is the leading technology company that empowers marketers to reach, engage, and convert audiences with precision. With 465 billion automated optimizations per second, the AI-powered StackAdapt Marketing Platform seamlessly connects brand and performance marketing to drive measurable results across the entire customer journey. The most forward-thinking marketers choose StackAdapt to orchestrate high-impact campaigns across programmatic advertising and marketing channels.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;StackAdapt is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Group Manager, Video Production&lt;/strong&gt; to raise the bar for how our brand comes to life through video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a role focused on simply producing more content. We are looking for someone who can create &lt;strong&gt;exceptional, memorable work at the highest creative standard&lt;/strong&gt;—from Super Bowl-quality brand commercials to customer stories so compelling they rival, and even outperform, our customers’ own brand advertising.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll help define what great video looks like at StackAdapt and build a video engine that combines &lt;strong&gt;world-class storytelling, creative ambition, and scalable production&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is simple: &lt;strong&gt;make people notice StackAdapt, remember StackAdapt, and understand the incredible customers, people, technology, and ideas behind our brand.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We&#39;ll Measure Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success isn&#39;t simply measured by how many videos we produce.&amp;nbsp;It&#39;s whether the work &lt;strong&gt;changes how people perceive StackAdapt.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will know this role is succeeding when StackAdapt&#39;s video is increasingly recognized for its creative quality, our commercials build meaningful brand awareness, our customer stories become content customers are proud to share themselves, and we have built a scalable system that allows us to produce more exceptional work around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;StackAdapt is building the future of advertising technology. This role has the opportunity to help build the &lt;strong&gt;story and brand that goes with it&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want someone who looks at the best commercials, branded films, customer stories, and cultural content in the world and thinks: &lt;strong&gt;“We can make something even better.”&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create Brand-Defining Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concept, produce, and deliver &lt;strong&gt;Super Bowl-quality commercials and brand campaigns&lt;/strong&gt; that can compete with the best advertising in the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our Creative and Brand teams to develop breakthrough ideas that build awareness and make StackAdapt memorable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate our brand positioning into stories that are emotional, entertaining, human, and highly shareable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push StackAdapt beyond traditional B2B and technology marketing conventions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reinvent the Customer Testimonial&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transform the traditional B2B case study into something people &lt;strong&gt;actually want to watch&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create customer films that are so beautifully produced and creatively compelling that they can be &lt;strong&gt;stronger than the customer&#39;s own brand commercials&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find the human stories behind the results—great people, bold ideas, breakthrough campaigns, and meaningful business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make our customers the heroes while demonstrating the role StackAdapt played&lt;br&gt;in their success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the Bar for Video&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a new standard for cinematography, storytelling, editing, sound, motion, and overall production quality across StackAdapt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop everything from flagship commercials and cinematic customer stories to product films, executive storytelling, social video, event content, and brand documentaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know when something requires a major production—and when a small team with a great idea can create something remarkable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continually challenge the organization to ask: &lt;strong&gt;“Is this good enough to represent the brand we&#39;re becoming?”&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a Scalable Video Engine&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase both the &lt;strong&gt;quality and quantity&lt;/strong&gt; of video produced across StackAdapt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop repeatable formats, production systems, templates, and workflows that allow us to move faster without lowering the creative standard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage a world-class network of directors, production companies, cinematographers, editors, animators, sound designers, and other creative partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find ways to turn every major production into an ecosystem of content across CTV, digital, social, events, sales, product marketing, and owned channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring to the Table&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are equal parts &lt;strong&gt;storyteller, producer, creative thinker, and craftsperson&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have exceptional creative taste and know the difference between content that is technically well produced and work that people genuinely remember.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio of &lt;strong&gt;exceptional commercial, brand, documentary, or customer storytelling work&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience taking productions from initial idea through concepting, pre-production, filming, post-production, and final delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The creative ambition and production expertise to deliver&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;national TV/CTV-caliber advertising&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong instincts for storytelling, casting, directing, cinematography, editing, music,&lt;br&gt;sound, and pacing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to uncover compelling human stories from customers, employees,&lt;br&gt;and executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing agencies, directors, production companies, freelancers, budgets, schedules, and complex shoots.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to move comfortably between &lt;strong&gt;big-budget hero productions and fast, scrappy experimentation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of how video performs across TV/CTV, YouTube, social, digital, events, and emerging channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A willingness to challenge conventional B2B marketing and push for work that is more ambitious, entertaining, and culturally relevant.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing full-time direct reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The compensation range listed for this role reflects the expected base salary for candidates located in the posting country based on a global rate. It is informed by market data and the approved budget for this position. StackAdapt maintains different compensation ranges for roles across other countries and regions, and final offers will be aligned to the candidate’s current location. &lt;em&gt;We do not ask c&lt;/em&gt;andidates about current or prior salary history, and we will not use such information, if volunteered, in setting an offer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This range represents base salary only. Depending on the role, candidates may also be eligible for additional compensation such as annual bonuses, commissions, equity awards, and a comprehensive benefits package.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factors Influencing Final Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The final compensation offer will be determined by a variety of factors, which may include, but are not limited to: the candidate&#39;s specific experience, technical skills, knowledge, abilities, and relevant education, licensure, and certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other business factors, such as organizational needs and budget alignment, may also be considered in the final offer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Canada Base Salary Band&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$148,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$203,500 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;USA Base Salary Band&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$160,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$220,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;StackAdapter&#39;s Enjoy:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Highly competitive salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Retirement/ 401K/ Pension Savings globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Competitive Paid time off packages including birthday&#39;s off!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Access to a comprehensive mental health care program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Health benefits from day one of employment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Work from home reimbursements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Optional global WeWork membership for those who want a change from their home office and hubs in London and Toronto&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Robust training and onboarding program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Coverage and support of personal development initiatives (conferences, courses, books etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Access to StackAdapt programmatic courses and certifications to support continuous learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;An awesome parental leave program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A friendly, welcoming, and supportive culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Our social and team events!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note: Benefits and perks may vary depending on your country of employment and the nature of your engagement. In locations where StackAdapt does not have a legal entity, employment and benefits are administered in accordance with local regulations and partner policies.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot; data-qa=&quot;closing-description&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;StackAdapt is a diverse and inclusive team of collaborative, hardworking individuals trying to make a dent in the universe. No matter who you are, where you are from, who you love, follow in faith, disability, superpower status, ethnicity, or the gender you identify with (if you’re comfortable, let us know your pronouns), you are welcome at StackAdapt. If you have any requests or requirements to support you throughout any part of the interview process, please let our Talent team know.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We use artificial intelligence (AI) to streamline the resume reviews of candidates and assess their fit based on the criteria outlined in the job posting. We do not use AI to make any final hiring or interview decisions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
